      <memberdef kind="function" id="classthemis_1_1_downsampling_pipeline_1ad82493a14682b6d23ff7bd2d1be8f5b1" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>size_t</type>
        <definition>size_t themis::DownsamplingPipeline::refresh</definition>
        <argsstring>(int64_t to_ms=0)</argsstring>
        <name>refresh</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::DownsamplingPipeline::refresh</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>int64_t</type>
          <declname>to_ms</declname>
          <defval>0</defval>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Process all registered metrics from their stored watermark up to <computeroutput>to_ms</computeroutput>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Refresh.</para>
<para>For each registered metric, this method iterates through the tier list from finest to coarsest. Each tier reads from its input source (raw data for tier[0], tier[i-1] output for tier[i]) over the window [watermark, to_ms) and writes aggregate results back to <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_t_s_store" kindref="compound">TSStore</ref> under the derived metric name produced by <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_continuous_aggregate_manager_1a5c08da389c51794339466931f880ba82" kindref="member">ContinuousAggregateManager::derivedMetricName()</ref>.</para>
<para>After a successful write the per-tier watermark is advanced to <computeroutput>to_ms</computeroutput>.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>to_ms</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Upper bound of the refresh window (ms since epoch). Defaults to now() when 0. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Total number of aggregate data points written across all tiers.</para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">to_ms</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Input parameter. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Return value.</para>
</simplesect>
Calls: <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_downsampling_pipeline_1aa13c8c1ecf9c1a928a9fd050ad6670d5" kindref="member">refreshMetric()</ref>. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
