    <briefdescription>
<para>Orchestrates multi-tier downsampling for one or more metrics. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The pipeline owns a <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_continuous_aggregate_manager" kindref="compound">ContinuousAggregateManager</ref> and per-metric watermarks. Callers invoke <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_downsampling_pipeline_1ad82493a14682b6d23ff7bd2d1be8f5b1" kindref="member">refresh()</ref> periodically (e.g. from <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_aggregate_scheduler" kindref="compound">AggregateScheduler</ref>) to process newly ingested data from the last watermark up to <computeroutput>now</computeroutput>.</para>
<para>Thread safety: <ref refid="classthemis_1_1_downsampling_pipeline_1ad82493a14682b6d23ff7bd2d1be8f5b1" kindref="member">refresh()</ref> is NOT thread-safe. External callers must serialise concurrent refreshes for the same pipeline instance. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
